OL,3,GNEWSA'I took Fairford pic - then all
OL,4,Ahell broke loose'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man who took a now-famous photo of
OL,7,Fthe five men arrested at RAF Fairford
OL,8,Fsaid he thought nothing of it until he
OL,9,Fwoke up the following morning.
OL,11,F"I saw the guys being arrested outside
OL,12,Fthe house on Sunday morning and went
OL,13,Fback to bed and went to sleep and
OL,14,Fthought, 'oh, well they've got them
OL,15,Fnow'," said the man, who lives in
OL,16,FWhelford. "Then all hell broke loose at
OL,17,Fhalf past six in the morning," he
OL,18,Fadded.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
