OL,3,GNEWSA'I took Fairford pic - then all
OL,4,Ahell broke loose'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt a police information point at
OL,7,FFairford Community Centre earlier, he -
OL,8,Falong with other locals - said
OL,9,Fcommunication from the military base
OL,10,Fhad been "poor" following the major
OL,11,Fsecurity incident.
OL,13,FThe US Air Force has been approached
OL,14,Ffor comment.
